{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんこんばんは！\n新内眞衣です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブで\n頭がいっぱいだった日々を終えて、\nふと一息つくと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"周りが見えてくる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなにも、\n夜が長くなって\n気温が下がっているんだなぁと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日久しぶりに３０分だけ\n早起きしたら\n外が暗くて驚きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝の通勤、\nトレンチコートではもう寒いから\n厚手のコートにしたいなあ～。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"買いに行かなきゃ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとニットも欲しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋は本当に一瞬"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/24/7973846/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってなわけで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブ\n全１８公演、無事に完走しました～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"怪我や風邪などたくさんの苦難が\nあったけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このメンバーだったから\n乗り切ることが出来ました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のテーマは『魅せる』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私的に思い入れのある\nポイントごとに\nレポしていきたいと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/24/7973846/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"１人MC"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"くじで順番を決めて私は９人目。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台の上で\nたった１人でお客さんを\n楽しませるなんて\n不安しかありませんでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな中で私が考えたのは、\n勝手にランキング！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はアンダーメンバーの最年長なので、\n妹にしたいランキングを\nトーク中心に展開しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさん文を考えたのに、\n本番はちょくちょく飛んでしまって\n何話したか正直覚えてないです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくれた方は\n楽しんでいただけたでしょうか？\nたくさん声援をくれて\n本当に嬉しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにランキングは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1位和田まあや\n2位中元日芽香\n3位川後陽菜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この３人には最後の乃木坂の詩の前の\nMCでも、いじらせてもらいました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当可愛い！！！\nありがとね！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/24/7973846/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"緊張したけど\nいい経験になりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/24/7973846/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パフォーマンス"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダンスパート"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回新たに、\nダンスで魅せるパートが加わったり\n狼に口笛をがNewバージョンの\n振り付けになったり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかく踊る！踊る！踊る！\nブロックがありました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モバメでよく言ってた\n筋肉痛はこれの練習。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初は全然揃わなくて\nグダグダだったけど、\n頑張りました～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして！\n2期生ダンケシェーン！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブ3クール目にして\n初めてセンターで\n踊らさせていただきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に1回1回大切にしていた曲。\nソロパートもあったり\n大変だったけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段見られない景色を経験出来て\n嬉しかったです、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コールを送ってくれた\n皆さんもありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/24/7973846/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして\n今回も２期生だけの\nパフォーマンスの場面を\n作って頂きありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/24/7973846/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寧々さんの卒業"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きな寧々さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何から話していいのか\nわかりませんが、\n私にとっては本当に特別な存在でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めて辞める意思を聞いたのは\n気づいたら片想いの\nジャケット写真撮影。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"泣き顔がテーマだった撮影中に\nいきなり切り出してきたのを\n今でも覚えてます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昇格したばかりで、\n何もかもが初めてだった私に\n優しくしてくれた寧々さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"特にのぎ天で行った\nパリではほとんど一緒に\n行動してたので、\n思い出がたくさんあります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブの千秋楽\n涙頃はピンクとオレンジで\n埋め尽くされた\n光景を舞台袖で見てて、\nマネージャーと泣いてました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒に見たかったな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、\nスペシャル公演で踊れて嬉しかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に大好きです！これからも！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/24/7973846/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/24/7973846/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/24/7973846/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これらの他にも語り尽くせないほど\n毎日ドラマがありました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無謀だと思っていた18公演。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張ってきたメンバー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"支えてくれたスタッフさん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"応援しにきてくれた皆さん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それぞれの力が重なりあったから\nこそ出来たステージ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/24/7973846/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初のアンダーライブで\n人が集まらなかった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの半年前から、\nこんなにも成長出来たのは\nみんながいたからこそ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/24/7973846/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に本当に\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は長くなってしまったので\nこの辺でおしまいです(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別握手会の事は\nまた今度！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後は寧々ちゃん\nスペシャル。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"牛久ライブ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/24/7973846/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつかの個別"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/24/7973846/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"振袖寧々ちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/24/7973846/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生まれたままでMV撮影"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/24/7973846/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2周年記念LIVE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/24/7973846/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここにいる理由乃木どこ収録"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/24/7973846/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブ O-EAST"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/24/7973846/0014.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パリ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/24/7973846/0015.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お団子おそろ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/24/7973846/0016.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かるた大会"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/24/7973846/0017.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/24/7973846/0018.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}